"\<\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"  We study the geometry and mechanics (both classical \
and quantum) of potential\\nwells described by squares of Chebyshev \
polynomials. We show that in a small\\nneighbourhood of the locus cut out by \
them in the space of hyperelliptic\\ncurves, these systems exhibit \
low-orders/low-orders resurgence, where\\nperturbative fluctuations about the \
vacuum determine perturbative fluctuations\\nabout non-perturbative \
saddles.\\n\"\>"}], ",", 
