    RowBox[{"\<\"title\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"Exact WKB analysis and TBA equations for the Mathieu \
equation\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"comments\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"17 pages, 5 figures\"\>"}], 
    ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"journal-ref\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"Phys. Lett. B 806 (2020) 135500\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"doi\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"10.1016/j.physletb.2020.135500\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"report-no\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"TIT/HEP-679\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"categories\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"hep-th math-ph math.MP quant-ph\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"license\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", \
"\<\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"  We derive the Thermodynamic Bethe Ansatz (TBA) \
equations for the exact WKB\\nperiods of the Mathieu equation in the weak \
coupling region. We will use the\\nTBA equations to calculate the quantum \
corrections to the WKB periods, which\\nare regarded the quantum periods of $\
\\\\mathcal{N} = 2$ $SU(2)$ super Yang-Mills\\ntheory at strong coupling. We \
calculate the effective central charge of the TBA\\nequations, which is found \
to be proportional to the coefficient of the one-loop\\nbeta function of the \
4d theory. We also study the spectral problem for the\\nMathieu equation \
based on the TBA equations numerically.\\n\"\>"}], ",", 
