   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\<\"id\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"2004.10722\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"submitter\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"Davide Fioravanti\"\>"}], 
    ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"authors\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"Davide Fioravanti, Marco Rossi, Hongfei Shu\"\>"}], ",", 
    
    RowBox[{"\<\"title\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"$QQ$-system and non-linear integral equations for \
scattering amplitudes\\n  at strong coupling\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"comments\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"Latex, 22 pages\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"journal-ref\"\>", "\[Rule]", "Null"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"doi\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"10.1007/JHEP12(2020)086\"\>"}], 
    ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"report-no\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"NORDITA 2020-035\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"categories\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"hep-th math-ph math.MP nlin.SI\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"license\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", \
"\<\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"  We provide the two fundamental sets of functional \
relations which describe\\nthe strong coupling limit of scattering amplitudes \
in $\\\\mathcal{N} = 4$ SYM\\ndual to Wilson loops in $AdS_3$: the basic \
$QQ$-system and the derived\\n$TQ$-system. We use the $TQ$ relations and the \
knowledge of the main properties\\nof the $Q$-function (eigenvalue of some \
$Q$-operator) to write the Bethe Ansatz\\nequations, {\\\\it viz.} a set of \
('complex') non-linear-integral equations, whose\\nsolutions give exact \
values to the strong coupling amplitudes/Wilson loops.\\nMoreover, they have \
some advantages with respect to the ('real')\\nnon-linear-integral equations \
of Thermodynamic Bethe Ansatz and still\\nreproduce, both analytically and \
numerically, the findings coming from the\\nlatter. In any case, these new \
functional and integral equations give a larger\\nperspective on the \
topic.\\n\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"versions\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
