    RowBox[{"\<\"report-no\"\>", "\[Rule]", "Null"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"categories\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"hep-th\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"license\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", \
"\<\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"  In this paper we investigate different ways of \
deriving the A-cycle period as\\na series in instanton counting parameter $q$ \
for ${\\\\cal N}=2$ SYM with up to\\nfour antifundamental hypermultiplets in \
NS limit of $\\\\Omega$ background. We\\npropose a new method for calculating \
the period and demonstrate its efficiency\\nby explicit calculations. The new \
way of doing instanton counting is more\\nadvantageous compared to known \
standard techniques and allows to reach\\nsubstantially higher order terms \
with less effort. This approach is applied for\\nthe pure case as well as for \
the case with several hypermultiplets.\\n  We also investigate a numerical \
method for deriving the $A$-cycle period\\nvalid for arbitrary values of $q$. \
Analyzing large $q$ asymptotic we get\\nconvincing agreement with an analytic \
expression deduced from a conjecture by\\nAlexei Zamolodchikov in a different \
context.\\n\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"versions\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
