     "\[Rule]", \
"\<\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"  We apply the exact WKB analysis to the quantum \
Seiberg-Witten curve for\\n4-dimensional $\\\\mathcal{N} = 2\\\\ SU(2)\\\\ \
N_f=2$ SQCD with the flavor symmetry.\\nThe discontinuity and the asymptotic \
behavior of the quantum periods define a\\nRiemann-Hilbert problem. We derive \
the thermodynamic Bethe ansatz (TBA)\\nequations as a solution to this \
problem. We also compute the effective central\\ncharge of the underlying \
CFT, which is shown to be proportional to the one-loop\\nbeta function of the \
SQCD.\\n\"\>"}], ",", 
