     "\[Rule]", "\<\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/\"\>"}],
     ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"  We study the WKB periods for the $(r+1)$-th order \
ordinary differential\\nequation (ODE) which is obtained by the conformal \
limit of the linear problem\\nassociated with the $A_r^{(1)}$ affine Toda \
field equation. We compute the\\nquantum corrections by using the \
Picard-Fuchs operators. The ODE/IM\\ncorrespondence provides a relation \
between the Wronskians of the solutions and\\nthe Y-functions which satisfy \
the thermodynamic Bethe ansatz (TBA) equation\\nrelated to the Lie algebra \
$A_r$. For the quadratic potential, we propose a\\nformula to show the \
equivalence between the logarithm of the Y-function and the\\nWKB period, \
which is confirmed by solving the TBA equation numerically.\\n\"\>"}], ",", 
