    RowBox[{"\<\"license\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\"\>"}], ",", 
    
    RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"  We study the anisotropic Kondo line defects in \
products of chiral $SU(2)$ WZW\\nmodels. We propose an ODE/IM correspondence \
for the anisotropic Kondo problems\\nby considering the four-dimensional \
Chern Simons theory in the trigonometric\\ncase. We verify the claim both by \
explicit perturbative calculations in the\\nultraviolet and by exact WKB \
analysis in the infrared. In doing so, we derived\\nthe infrared dynamics of \
a large class of anisotropic line defects.\\n\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"versions\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
