amplitude/Wilson lines\\n  duality at strong coupling\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"comments\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"31 pages, 8 figures\"\>"}], 
    ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"journal-ref\"\>", "\[Rule]", "Null"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"doi\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"10.1007/JHEP05(2022)099\"\>"}], 
    ",", 
