    RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"  We show that previous correspondence between some \
(integrable) statistical\\nfield theory quantities and periods of $SU(2)$ $\\\
\\mathcal{N}=2$ deformed gauge\\ntheory still holds if we add $N_f=1,2$ \
flavours of matter. Moreover, the\\ncorrespondence entails a new \
non-perturbative solution to the theory.\\nEventually, we use this solution \
to give exact results on quasinormal modes of\\nblack branes and \
holes.\\n\"\>"}], ",", 
