   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\<\"id\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"2305.03283\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"submitter\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"Mingshuo Zhu\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"authors\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"Katsushi Ito, Mingshuo Zhu\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"title\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"WKB analysis of the linear problem for modified affine \
Toda field\\n  equations\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"comments\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"42 pages\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"journal-ref\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"JHEP08(2023)007\"\>"}], 
    ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"doi\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"10.1007/JHEP08(2023)007\"\>"}], 
    ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"report-no\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"TIT/HEP-694\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"categories\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"hep-th math-ph math.MP\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"license\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", \
"\<\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"  We study the WKB analysis of the solutions to the \
linear problem for a\\nmodified affine Toda field equation, which is \
equivalent to the higher-order\\nordinary differential equation (ODE) studied \
in the ODE/IM correspondence.\\nAfter gauge transformation, we diagonalize \
the flat connection of the linear\\nproblem to reduce the latter to a set of \
independent first-order linear\\ndifferential equations. We explicitly \
perform this procedure for classical\\naffine Lie algebras with lower ranks. \
In particular, we study the WKB solutions\\nof the $D_r^{(1)}$- and \
$D^{(2)}_{r+1}$-type linear problems, which correspond\\nto the higher-order \
ODEs with the pseudo-differential operator. The\\ndiagonalized connection is \
obtained from the Riccati equations of the adjoint\\nlinear problem and \
related to the conserved currents of the integrable\\nhierarchy constructed \
by Drinfeld and Sokolov up to total derivatives.\\n\"\>"}], ",", 
