   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"\<\"id\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"2405.13830\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"submitter\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"Paolo Arnaudo\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"authors\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"Paolo Arnaudo, Giulio Bonelli, Alessandro Tanzini\"\>"}],
     ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"title\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"One loop effective actions in Kerr-(A)dS Black \
Holes\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"comments\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"35 pages\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"journal-ref\"\>", "\[Rule]", "Null"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"doi\"\>", "\[Rule]", "Null"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"report-no\"\>", "\[Rule]", "Null"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"categories\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"hep-th gr-qc math-ph math.MP\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"license\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", \
"\<\"http://arxiv.org/licenses/nonexclusive-distrib/1.0/\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"abstract\"\>", 
     "\[Rule]", "\<\"  We compute new exact analytic expressions for one-loop \
scalar effective\\nactions in Kerr (A)dS black hole (BH) backgrounds in four \
and five dimensions.\\nThese are computed by the connection coefficients of \
the Heun equation via a\\ngeneralization of the Gelfand-Yaglom formalism to \
second-order linear ODEs with\\nregular singularities. The expressions we \
find are in terms of\\nNekrasov-Shatashvili special functions, making \
explicit the analytic properties\\nof the one-loop effective actions with \
respect to the gravitational parameters\\nand the precise contributions of \
the quasi-normal modes. The latter arise via\\nan associated integrable \
system. In particular, we prove asymptotic formulae\\nfor large angular \
momenta in terms of hypergeometric functions and give a\\nprecise \
mathematical meaning to Rindler-like region contributions. Moreover \
we\\nidentify the leading terms in the large distance expansion as the \
point\\nparticle approximation of the BH and their finite size corrections as \
encoding\\nthe BH tidal response. We also discuss exact properties of the \
thermal version\\nof the BH effective actions. Although we focus on the real \
scalar field in\\ndS-Kerr and (A)dS-Schwarzschild in four and five \
dimensions, similar formulae\\ncan be given for higher spin matter and \
radiation fields in more general\\ngravitational backgrounds.\\n\"\>"}], ",", 
    
    RowBox[{"\<\"versions\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\<\"version\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"v1\"\>"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\<\"created\"\>", 
         "\[Rule]", "\<\"Wed, 22 May 2024 16:58:05 GMT\"\>"}]}], "}"}], 
      "}"}]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"update_date\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"2024-05-24\"\>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"\<\"authors_parsed\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
